<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT NORTHERN TRANSVAAL 35-23.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT NORTHERN TRANSVAAL 35-23.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State beat Northern</p>
<p>Transvaal 35-23 (halftime 28-11) in a rugby union Super 12 match</p>
<p>on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal - Tries; Nicky van der Walt, Matthys</p>
<p>Bekker, Kobus Engelbrecht, Conversion; Casper Steyn, Penalties;</p>
<p>Casper Steyn (2)</p>
<p>Free State - Tries; Helgard Muller, Andre Venter, Chris</p>
<p>Badenhorst (2), Brendan Venter, Conversions; Jannie de Beer (5)</p>
</text>
